  "releaseNotes": "# v0.9.3\n- Made random helper methods public (Whoops!)\n- Added abstract class LinkedEvent\n- Added class InventoryItem\n- Added abstract class Plugin\n\n# v0.9.2\n- Added static DataContainer constructor for better data management use cases.\n- Added CalloutPriorityAttribute (required during admin-induced priority periods)\n- Added SelectRandom extensions for Dictionary and Array types.\n- Added new Ended boolean to the Callout class for detecting if a callout ended early.\n- Added new TryGetNextSeatFree extension for Vehicle types.\n\n# v0.9.1\n - Added summaries to API endpoints\n - Added QueueService\n\n# v0.9.0\n - Implemented License Validation Server and attributed premium features\n - Added new EntityExtensions",
